+# Welcome code reusable after cancel, and free shipping at €50.00 check
+
+Two reports, checked against the rules in `README.md`.
+
+## 1. Single-use code refused after its order was cancelled (customer, Paolo)
+
+- Paolo placed an order with his one-time welcome code, cancelled it the same day, and the corrected
+  order was refused: the code was "already used".
+- Rule: "Cancelling it returns its units and gives back its coupon, if the coupon was single-use"
+  (Orders); "if that order is cancelled, the coupon can be used again" (Discounts).
+- Cause: `OrderService.cancel` in `src/orders.ts` calls `Coupons.giveBack(order.coupon, order.customer)`,
+  passing the customer's name. `Coupons.use` records the order's ID (`ORD-0001`, …), and `giveBack`
+  only frees the code when the recorded order matches, so the name never matches and the code stays used.
+- Acceptance: after a single-use coupon's order is cancelled, the same coupon can be used by a new
+  order. A cancelled order that did not use a coupon, or used a non-single-use coupon, is unaffected.
+
+## 2. Delivery charged on goods of €50.00 (support, customer)
+
+- A customer paid €4.90 delivery on an order whose goods came to exactly €50.00.
+- Rule: "Shipping is free when the goods come to €50.00 or more, after every discount and before VAT"
+  (Shipping). The threshold is already `>=` (task-001, commit 2ace33d), and a test covers exactly
+  5000 cents with no discount.
+- Checked: an order of €50.00 without discounts ships free; a gross of €50.00 with a volume discount
+  has goods of €45.00 after discount and pays the band cost, as the rule says. No path found where
+  goods of €50.00 after discounts pay delivery.
+- Outcome: no code change for this report. The cause cannot be settled from the code alone: the order
+  is needed (its lines, any coupon, and its date) to tell whether it predates the threshold fix or
+  the customer's "€50.00" is the amount before discounts. Not changed here.
+
+## Traceability
+
+- Requirements: the Orders and Discounts rules for cancellation and single-use coupons, and the
+  Shipping rule for free delivery, in `README.md`.
+- Tests: a regression test for item 1 is added under `test/orders.test.ts`.
